<title>UK: Ford Motor Credit prices $750 mln 5-yr FRN.</title>
<headline>Ford Motor Credit prices $750 mln 5-yr FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue, launched earlier in Asia, has been priced, joint lead managers Lehman Brothers and Merrill Lynch said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FORD MOTOR CREDIT</p>
<p> AMT    $750 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JAN.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     1/8 PCT   PAY DATE    17.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY A1	  ISS PRICE  99.847    FULL FEES   25 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A+	  REOFFER    99.847</p>
<p>LISTING LUX/HK/SI DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/HK/SI  MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
